---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 bg-muted/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
        In a nutshell, <strong>it’s all about creating a common language.</strong>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      {/* Feature 1 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">M1</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Structuring systems and methods to create a common language. Based on
          the <strong>RDS 81346</strong> <strong>Standard Series</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Feature 2 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">M2</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          System development in terms of integration, requirements,
          descriptions, stakeholders, and information.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Feature 3 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">M3</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Relating systems across domains, such as design, manufacturing,
          service, etc.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
